   240→ * SPEC FUNCTION
   241→ * https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/v1.6.0-alpha.4/specs/fulu/p2p-interface.md#verify_data_column_sidecar_inclusion_proof
   242→ */
   243→export function verifyDataColumnSidecarInclusionProof(dataColumnSidecar: fulu.DataColumnSidecar): boolean {
